<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wedlock Account Activation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            width: 90%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .code {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Welcome to Wedlock</h2>
        <p>Thank you for signing up! Please use the following 4-digit activation code to activate your account:</p>
        <div class="code"><%= activationCode %></div>
        <p>This code will expire in 5 minutes.</p>
        <p>If you did not sign up for this account, please ignore this email.</p>
        <p>Best regards,</p>
        <p>The Team</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Wedlock. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
